{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "stories": [
    {
      "id": "amane-hikari-post-20261119154822668000",
      "model_id": "amane-hikari",
      "published_at": "2026-11-19T15:48:22.668+09:00",
      "setting": {
        "year": 2031,
        "month": 11
      },
      "text": "差し入れの焼き栗をみんなで分けて、最後のひとつはじゃんけん。勝ったのに、みんなに見られてちょっと食べづらかった😂",
      "source": {
        "issue_slug": "november-city-lights-hikari-006",
        "cut_id": "08",
        "image_sha256": "2b493c0fc5e7a41091de6a977e9ff6cf79b8f2acc393d8ab5348300c8921c948"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "amane-hikari-post-20261120155620361000",
      "model_id": "amane-hikari",
      "published_at": "2026-11-20T15:56:20.361+09:00",
      "setting": {
        "year": 2031,
        "month": 11
      },
      "text": "控室でマフラーを巻いたら、左右の長さが全然合わなくて三回やり直し。もう出発しなきゃなのに、あと一回だけ😂",
      "source": {
        "issue_slug": "november-city-lights-hikari-006",
        "cut_id": "09",
        "image_sha256": "ea128664af1643d1179c74fe75e4473f30e8385a752c10b0fe6bd097201d8c35"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "amane-hikari-post-20261121154748851000",
      "model_id": "amane-hikari",
      "published_at": "2026-11-21T15:47:48.851+09:00",
      "setting": {
        "year": 2031,
        "month": 11
      },
      "text": "午後のリハで新しい曲の間奏だけ何度も合わせた。最後に全員ぴたりと止まった瞬間、思わず顔を見合わせて笑っちゃった。あれ、もう一回やりたい！",
      "source": {
        "issue_slug": "november-city-lights-hikari-006",
        "cut_id": "02",
        "image_sha256": "d0ea10b9e89eb6f4e77f9a5f3def26d7b8e3299d1b6ca6476608810d567be1a8"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "amane-hikari-post-20261122155039122000",
      "model_id": "amane-hikari",
      "published_at": "2026-11-22T15:50:39.122+09:00",
      "setting": {
        "year": 2031,
        "month": 11
      },
      "text": "控室でカイロを握ってたら、みんなが順番に手を重ねてきた。あっという間に温かくなったけど、最後は私のカイロが冷めちゃった😂",
      "source": {
        "issue_slug": "november-hikari-city-and-pool-013",
        "cut_id": "02",
        "image_sha256": "2d5201a360579e805a4bf6622dd70b4188b397087506eb8dbf0989dcd5f225cc"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "amane-hikari-post-20261123154636284",
      "model_id": "amane-hikari",
      "published_at": "2026-11-23T15:46:36.284+09:00",
      "setting": {
        "year": 2031,
        "month": 11
      },
      "text": "午後の練習前、立ち位置の目印に色テープを貼った。私のだけ斜めで、直したら隣の子の印とくっついちゃった😂",
      "source": {
        "issue_slug": "november-hikari-city-and-pool-013",
        "cut_id": "01",
        "image_sha256": "aeffd0c4a529a9181ace87fc71883f2d102b09079499ce0e61b9d6f774b6c2eb"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "amane-hikari-post-20261124154547610",
      "model_id": "amane-hikari",
      "published_at": "2026-11-24T15:45:47.610+09:00",
      "setting": {
        "year": 2031,
        "month": 11
      },
      "text": "休憩中に外へ出たら風が冷たくて、みんなで日なたへ移動。温かいココアを飲みながら、次の曲の振りをこっそり合わせてた。",
      "source": {
        "issue_slug": "november-hikari-city-and-pool-013",
        "cut_id": "03",
        "image_sha256": "4ac12dbb999f6cd2010772f5b89926496a6936e269e92fe59b074ee7191ab89b"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "amane-hikari-post-20261125154607989",
      "model_id": "amane-hikari",
      "published_at": "2026-11-25T15:46:07.989+09:00",
      "setting": {
        "year": 2031,
        "month": 11
      },
      "text": "移動の合間に焼き芋を買ったら、半分に割るのが下手すぎて私の方が大きくなっちゃった。ちゃんと分け直したよ！",
      "source": {
        "issue_slug": "november-hikari-city-and-pool-013",
        "cut_id": "04",
        "image_sha256": "8ea71ddcffffb899154e2360932a1de78f747159d0403330c5254837cf0f3108"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "amane-hikari-post-20261126154238492",
      "model_id": "amane-hikari",
      "published_at": "2026-11-26T15:42:38.492+09:00",
      "setting": {
        "year": 2031,
        "month": 11
      },
      "text": "午後の発声練習、乾燥で喉が気になって加湿器をつけた。湯気を眺めてたら出だしを忘れちゃって、みんなに笑われた😂",
      "source": {
        "issue_slug": "november-hikari-city-and-pool-013",
        "cut_id": "05",
        "image_sha256": "8607882879e36cea445980717ff386f33a89c3e72a2e6d6c78a2684abac262d8"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "amane-hikari-post-20261127154843149",
      "model_id": "amane-hikari",
      "published_at": "2026-11-27T15:48:43.149+09:00",
      "setting": {
        "year": 2031,
        "month": 11
      },
      "text": "振付の確認動画を見返したら、私だけ最後のポーズで笑いすぎてた。次は真顔で決めようって言ったそばから、また笑っちゃった😂",
      "source": {
        "issue_slug": "november-hikari-city-and-pool-013",
        "cut_id": "06",
        "image_sha256": "f8fb9f7cea22b7cffa03fefbdb28e91e7c51c1b9cb60dc5b8cc5223537945361"
      }
    }
  ]
